#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:55
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PCStorageSystem"
msgid ""
"That PC-based POKéMON Storage\n"
"System…\p"
"Whoever made it must be some kind\n"
"of a scientific wizard!$"
msgstr ""
"那个用电脑来寄放宝可梦的系统……\p"
"发明它的人一定是个\n"
"科学天才吧！$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_OranBerryRegainedHP"
msgid ""
"When my POKéMON ate an\n"
"ORAN BERRY, it regained HP!$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦吃了橙橙果以后，\n"
"HP就回复了！$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ManyTypesOfPokemon"
msgid ""
"There are many types of POKéMON.\p"
"All types have their strengths and\n"
"weaknesses against other types.\p"
"Depending on the types of POKéMON,\n"
"a battle could be easy or hard.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦有很多种属性。\p"
"每种属性对其他属性\n"
"都有各自的优势和劣势。\p"
"根据宝可梦的属性不同，\n"
"对战可能会变得轻松或者困难。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TreeckoIsGrassType"
msgid ""
"For example, your TREECKO\n"
"is a GRASS type.\p"
"It's strong against the WATER and\n"
"GROUND types.\p"
"But, it's weak against FIRE-type\n"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"比如说，你的木守宫\n"
"是草属性的。\p"
"它对水属性和地面属性很有利。\p"
"但是，它很怕火属性的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TorchicIsFireType"
msgid ""
"For example, your TORCHIC\n"
"is a FIRE type.\p"
"It's strong against the GRASS and\n"
"BUG types.\p"
"But, it's weak against WATER-type\n"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"比如说，你的火稚鸡\n"
"是火属性的。\p"
"它对草属性和虫属性很有利。\p"
"但是，它很怕水属性的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MudkipIsWaterType"
msgid ""
"For example, your MUDKIP\n"
"is a WATER type.\p"
"It's strong against the FIRE type.\p"
"But, it's weak against GRASS-type\n"
"and ELECTRIC-type POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"比如说，你的水跃鱼\n"
"是水属性的。\p"
"它对火属性很有利。\p"
"但是，它很怕草属性和\n"
"电属性的宝可梦。$"
